03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qY5KU5ZDwuAQ7kNvwFr6wo3&_nc_oc=Ados8Vs2svZxGmPyn3kY4tPwLAdoo072y5TXH8oA3UtH3HrWJez4vSoWp6dcZRm3f-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCO4gY11bGDGQUnFNB0YkeBPf7CGl5TZIXcVUSEbkx1_Q&oe=6A60BA26"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fWlEBJD7PmUQ7kNvwGJViKo&_nc_oc=AdrFjzHcGc18OiS9b6492WFGTZuLV8tBXQZjc1gogQNxewbAkkvRhqN-AxP9-uMMtXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCJpIz8Sfykk3p27WsZl5bpvLh7lK8k6_D-WT6Pen1thA&oe=6A60C545"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V8O_B3uAlDMQ7kNvwHNiTJU&_nc_oc=Adr9AhvVkTzFPKsvkxzA16gjbLcqqRvanhEeGC391B6i-nvaaLiI7eVfzrRzRpU42UY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAIuwZ8u-xxlvaF_o53iw7J0CIbRrfdNamhplv4GnaD6g&oe=6A60C2EC"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kS8souMAT4EQ7kNvwGaNcqu&_nc_oc=AdrBKaUB1AM5lvyZGpbDg4_Qr7B9RwrqP6Ig_yMr0Tw0MoCZMPnIdFVlhvNKVg4Vlbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBJgl73rlZfZkxDLOVOyZCi-64YvR2WPO3TCOYJoSMMSg&oe=6A60D6A0"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQX9bUi3exwQ7kNvwFslAA7&_nc_oc=AdpyOBTlgdLxQkNhtGcfXif9wE6dSMu3QkWcSaARooIbXmwqGf3mPQ2ODs5X_CqmSBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBgmkKMN5t-tmbjRCkGuOhBsyMnww52n3edCgPnMYPLyg&oe=6A60CBB6"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WDec5H5RvucQ7kNvwHCaB_y&_nc_oc=AdqRtodooRJn-QzqlYOVnFhwKYujFHEN-enk5I-SMzRRzDdKwlrwHb9C6W038wqdAEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBKO6-npm0jh-EO7gBiVv9I_PkKRurROKyMWJ2OdGzvLg&oe=6A60C12F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWYjdthMltIQ7kNvwGubMCl&_nc_oc=Ado_lfXgxMT5T_AxDnemWODjykNe-Lbjt4Ux_Oq_CZ0YFZTNTbBIGKfcCYq4t21j6eM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQANcRo9jOcxLQrR69gFo1UdKVUE_sh21z62MAyWc1xOTQ&oe=6A60D1D5"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"